  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"本接口可进行线索通表单的删除，删除后获取表单列表时默认不获取，但是仍能通过表单实例id获取表单详情，is_del状态变为1。注：对于当日产生了线索数据的表单不支持删除，会报错。\",\"id\":\"ad.clue_form.delete\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/clue/form/delete/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710636402700\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求本接口需要先获取授权access-token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"ad.return_code.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"本接口的返回码和返回信息需要参考该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710636402700\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"删除表单\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sFSEWMih\">本接口可进行表单的删除，删除后获取表单列表时默认不获取，但是仍能通过表单实例id获取表单详情，is_del状态变为1。 <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">注：对于当日产生了线索数据的表单不支持删除，会报错：message：has clues today</span></p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201772941995483213%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-GTOvfYHf\" id=\"h6f20189-GTOvfYHf\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-1pCkKnga\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/clue/form/delete/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/clue/form/delete/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710636402700\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-dsICyCme\" id=\"h6f20189-dsICyCme\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-bPafFR2Z\">POST</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-Jb9ir257\" id=\"h6f20189-Jb9ir257\">请求Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t844fe7d-APWSD9bV\" data-transie